{"product_id":"the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-vol-4-the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-4","title":"The Dark History of the Reincarnated Villainess, Vol. 4 (The Dark History of the Reincarnated Villainess, 4)","description":"\u003cp\u003eNo matter how much I rewrite the story... nothing changes! Konoha Satou’s Dark History first began with a self-indulgent fantasy romance fic written in her teens. Since she is now its most abominable villainess, the details of the story are a matter of life-and-death! Narrowly avoiding the Bloody Rosa death flag and saving the duchess was supposed to be the end. Case closed. But when grave news reaches Iana at Dandelion Lake shortly after an assassination attempt on Konoha, she must accept that all is not as it seems. With her Dark History correcting itself in mysterious ways, Iana will need every shred of help she can get…or this chapter may be her last.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 128 x 189\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Akiharu Touka\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781975337346\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 160\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45434484293785,"sku":"Manga-A-39781975337346","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/683b232bb8402-The-Dark-History-of-the-Reincarnated-Villainess-Vol-4-The-Dark-History-of-the-Rein_4315_1.jpg?v=1753121626","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-vol-4-the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-4","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}